(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-03","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["拿到阅档[[permission|许可]]时，港务楼里正搬着纸箱。接待的[[clerk|职员]]听见父亲名字，先停了笔，随后请主管把旧[[catalogue|目录]]取来。事故[[document|文件]]只有六页，第三页后直接跳到第五页。我压住翘起的纸角，问第四页去了哪里。主管翻出两次搬库的清单，没有找到缺页，却在‘闸门操作簿’一栏发现‘另存’二字。程雾把目录与清单放在一起拍照，没有把沉默当作答案。","我们依[[chronology|时间顺序]]排好记录：旧结论称父亲三点四十分擅自[[departure|离港]]，水位站却记着当天[[tide|潮汐]]处于退落阶段，外河远低于港池。老陈说，两处水面当时由北闸隔开，应等水位接近再开。电话表还记着三点三十六分父亲要求暂缓开闸。这处[[discrepancy|差异]]让我把纸上的两行反复看了几遍：至少，父亲不是一句提醒也没留下。","秦衡送来的[[official|官方的]]展板图只有六个泊位，旧施工图却没有[[omit|遗漏]]河湾里的浮台。老陈把[[chart|图表]]转向窗边，指认出旧系缆桩：工人把临时装货台叫作七号，客票也用了这个名字。它没办成固定泊位，后来地图的[[label|标签]]便被删去。程雾将两幅图叠在灯下，河湾的位置仍然重合。秦衡那句‘从来没有’，突然显得太轻巧了。","主管让我们[[compare|比较]]展览誊抄件和档案复印件。两个[[version|版本]]都写着三点四十分，来电备注却不同：一份写‘林广申请暂缓’，一份写‘船长情绪异常’。我指着第二份[[duplicate|副本]]，问谁把请求改成了脾气。职员找到十年前秦衡申请[[revise|修改]]展文的附件，其中引用过这张电话表。何警官收下照片，让原件继续留库，我把手从纸上慢慢移开。","修船铺的面汤还冒着热气，程雾却先把本子推过来。她让我将[[assumption|假设]]与事实分栏，老陈则画出北闸，帮我[[clarify|澄清]]两处水面的关系。真正[[relevant|有关的]]，是闸门什么时候开，不是鬼从哪里来。这个[[inference|推断]]把下一步缩到旧维修通道：从那里能看到七号浮台的残件。老陈给值班员打电话申请检查，我这才端起已经凉了的碗。"],"en":["When we received [[permission|permission]] to consult the records, boxes were being moved inside the port building. The [[clerk|clerk]] stopped writing at Dad's name, then asked a supervisor to bring the old [[catalogue|catalogue]]. The accident [[document|document]] had only six pages, jumping from page three to page five. Holding down a curled corner, I asked where page four had gone. The supervisor checked two relocation lists. Neither supplied the missing page, but beside 'gate operating register' appeared 'stored separately'. Cheng photographed the catalogue and the lists together. She did not treat silence as an answer.","We arranged the records by [[chronology|chronology]]. The old finding placed Dad's unauthorized [[departure|departure]] at 3:40, but the water station recorded an ebb [[tide|tide]], with the outer river far below the basin. Chen explained that the north gate separated the two surfaces; it should have opened only when their levels were close. The phone sheet also recorded Dad's 3:36 request to delay opening. I read those lines repeatedly. Whatever else that [[discrepancy|discrepancy]] meant, Dad had left a warning.","Qin's [[official|official]] exhibition map showed six berths. The old construction drawing did not [[omit|omit]] the platform in the bend. Chen turned the [[chart|chart]] toward the window and recognized the former mooring post. Workers called the temporary loading platform Number Seven, and tickets had used the name too. It never became a permanent berth, so its [[label|label]] was later removed from maps. Cheng held the two drawings together against the light. The bend still lined up. Qin's claim that it had 'never existed' suddenly sounded far too easy.","The supervisor let us [[compare|compare]] the exhibition transcript with an archive photocopy. Both [[version|versions]] gave 3:40, but their telephone notes differed: one said 'Lin Guang requests a delay'; the other, 'captain emotionally unstable'. I pointed to the second [[duplicate|duplicate]] and asked who had turned a request into a temper. The clerk found an application Qin had made ten years earlier to [[revise|revise]] the display. Its attachment cited that phone sheet. Officer He took our photographs and asked that the originals remain in storage. I slowly removed my hand from the paper.","Noodle soup was steaming at the workshop, but Cheng first pushed a notebook toward me. She asked me to put each [[assumption|assumption]] apart from the facts. Chen drew the north gate to [[clarify|clarify]] the relationship between the two water levels. What was [[relevant|relevant]] was when the gate had opened, not where a ghost had appeared. That [[inference|inference]] narrowed our next step to the old maintenance passage, from which the platform's remains could be seen. Chen called the duty officer to request an inspection. Only then did I lift my now-cold bowl."]});
